#   --accel   DIIS | GDM | Ladder | directmin      (Ladder = None→DIIS→GDM hand-off)
#   --acc     Low | Medium | High                  (atomic basis pool; Sc/Medium was 8 mHa high)
#   --mom [--momstart N]                           Maximum Overlap Method (occupation continuity)
#   --merge <tol>                                  merge eigenlevels within ±tol (default 1e-4;
#                                                    too LARGE re-averages the m-split open shell)
#   --relax <a> --maxiter <n> --minfd/--minde/--virial/--minro <tol>
#   --kerker <G0> --pulay <depth> --pulaystart <n> periodic ρ̃-mixing (no-op on atoms/molecules)
